('linen-putih', 'dasar', 'hidup', 'Linen Putih', 'White Linen', 'Kain linen putih, gulungan linen berikat gandum, sutra krem, dan goni di jeda halaman.', 'White linen, a roll of linen tied with wheat, cream silk and burlap between the sections.', 'linen-putih', 4180),
